	)
	(text_box "ESP32-S3 Core Design Notes\n\n- ESP32-S3-MINI-1-N8: Wi-Fi and Bluetooth LE.\n- Module supply: +3V3, with local decoupling.\n- USB D- / D+: GPIO19 / GPIO20.\n- EN and BOOT: reset and download-mode buttons.\n- Internal I2C: GPIO13 / GPIO14, fuel gauge and sensors.\n- External I2C: GPIO1 / GPIO2, separate signal pair.\n- BMI323 INT1: GPIO15. Status LED: GPIO48.\n- Modem UART: GPIO17 / GPIO18, via U7 level shifter.\n- Keep the module antenna region unobstructed.\n- Rev A hardware testing and firmware remain pending."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.13 105.41 0)
		(size 77.47 52.1919)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
